{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 8, :comments ["<b>And if He expands, etc., to your fathers.</b> This means the fathers themselves, for they will inherit the land in the time to come, and He said that this will come to them if they keep the entire Torah and perform it, and the keeping and the performing will be from love of HaShem and not from fear. That generation which stands in this — in its days HaShem will establish His good word to give all the ten nations, and He will place in Israel's hand all the good that He promised to do for the fathers on the day they stand in resurrection. And our Sages of blessed memory (Sanhedrin 99b) already noted that the future redemption depends specifically on service of HaShem from love."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :or-hachaim, :lang :en, :chapter 19, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T19:18:02.373824428Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}